<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $44-1/8 (FIM 200.53).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $44-1/8 (FIM 200.53).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed up $0-3/4 at $44-1/8 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 200.53 markka. In Helsinki on Wednesday, Nokia closed up 3.00 markka at 199.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) closed unchanged at $32-3/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 73.56 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 1.10 markka at 74.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS closed flat at $21 (95.43 markka) in New York. Rauma rose 1.00 markka to 94.50 in Helsinki.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
